            F("Dr Price", "I'd avoid that. Some of the parts have sharp edges. Why not ask everyone to guess how many unused phones they have at home, and then show them the national average?"),
            M("Leo", "Oh, that's good. People always like guessing. I'll do that."),
            F("Dr Price", "Now, one more thing about your sources. The figure you give for the cost of recycling comes from a blog post. I'd like you to find a more reliable source for that number, ideally an official report."),
            M("Leo", "Right. I'll look for one. And how long should the presentation be? I've got about twenty minutes of material at the moment."),
            F("Dr Price", "That's too much. It mustn't be longer than fifteen minutes, and then there are five minutes for questions."),
            M("Leo", "Fifteen minutes. OK, I'll need to cut quite a lot. I'm planning to practise it in front of my flatmates this weekend. They'll tell me if it's boring!"),
