            F("Nadia", "Well, one idea is that the university should offer more jobs on campus. Students wouldn't waste time travelling, and the university could make sure the hours fit round lectures."),
            M("Josh", "Good. And for employers, one of the biggest complaints was that people only found out what shifts they were working a day or two before."),
            F("Nadia", "So we could recommend that employers give students their shift patterns at least two weeks in advance. That would make it much easier to plan study time."),
